    "If it still doesn't connect, check that Bluetooth and Wi-Fi are on for both devices." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "それでも接続できない場合は、両方のデバイスのBluetoothとWi‑Fiがオンか確認してください。"
