    },
    "If you do, you can check the remaining time right on your wrist while the timer runs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "お持ちなら、タイマー中に手首で残り時間をすぐ確認できます。"
